 <h3><u>Kaho ya mehdi</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ya mehdi..(6)<br> As salam as salam ae imame zamaan<br> Ya mehdi..(2)<br> KAHO YA MEHDI..(2)<br> Ye sari kaaenaat hai qaem imam se..(2)<br> Baaqi khuda ka naam hai Mehdi ke naam se<br> KAHO YA MEHDI..(3)</p> 
  <p><br> 1)Ek pal ko sochiye na agar ho shahe zamaa,<br> Baadal rahe na abr na barsaat ka nisha(n),<br> Pis jaye kaenat pahado(n) ke darmeya(n),<br> Dharti ke sar pe aan gire pal me aasma(n),<br> In saare haadsaat e zamaana ke saamne..(2)<br> Deewar khech rakhi hai mere imam ne..</p> 
  <p>2)Suraj ko saare raste batata hai khud Imaam,<br> Mashrik hai ye yaha se nikalna hai tera kaam,<br> Thak jaye gar safar me to phir bhi hai ek makaam,<br> Maghrib hai mere qadmo me karna yahi qayaam,<br> Kehde jahan se waase nikalta hai aaftab..(2)<br> Mehdi se puch-puch ke chalta hai aaftab…</p> 
  <p>3)Wo hai toh kaaenat hai, wo hai toh zindagi,<br> Wo hai to ye namaaz hai, wo hai toh bandagi,<br> Wo hai to aarahi hai sadaa Ya Hussain ki,<br> Wo hai to ho raha hai jahaa(n) me Ali-Ali,<br> Ab jo khilafe zikr e Ali lab hilaega..(2)<br> Duniya se be hisaab jahannam me jaega</p> 
  <p>4)Aane se uske hogi sitam ki kitaab band,<br> Hoga har ek muftiye shar ka nisaab band,<br> Ghaibat ka dar khula to khulenge hisaab band,<br> Maula kahenge hogaya tauba ka baab band,<br> Apne paron se pehle mohibbo(n) ko aad do..(2)<br> Jibreel phir zameen ko dozakh me jhaad do..</p> 
  <p>5)Raaze mukatteyaat ka hamraaz aega,<br> Qura(n) Ali ka likha hua saath laega,<br> Shaane nuzool aayato ki khud bataega,<br> Makki se makki , madni se madni milaega,<br> Far-far sahifa bolega uski janaab me..(2)<br> Wo jaan daal dega khuda ki kitab me..</p> 
  <p>6)Hoga imam e waqt yu masroofe kaar zaar,<br> Kaandhe pe be niyaam rakhi hogi Zulfiqaar,<br> Allah hoga khud wali-allah par nisaar,<br> Talwar khud kahegi jari waar-waar-waar,<br> Fehrist dede dushmane aale rasool ki..(2)<br> Phir dekh kya karegi saheli batul ki..</p> 
  <p>7)Tanzeeme rozgar ka nazim jab aaega,<br> Tabdiliyan bashar ki wo fitrat me laega,<br> Duniya ko apna hakke tasarruf dikhaega,<br> Insa(n) phir apni soch se bhi aage jaega,<br> Khairaat me imam se paega mojizaat..(2)<br> Mitti ka aadmi bhi dikhaega mojizaat,</p> 
  <p>8)Hogi qaza ke haath me jine ki jab umang,<br> Aajaega har ek bashar zindagi se tang,<br> Iblisiyat dikhaegi duniya ko apna rang,<br> Naeb khuda ka aake ladega khuda ki jung,<br> Mit jaega badi ka nisha(n) kaenaat se,<br> Shaitan maara jaega Mehdi ke haath se..</p> 
  <p>9)Yu aas hai zahoor ki dil ke deyaar me,<br> Akbar jo maut aa bhi gayi intezaar me,<br> Phir bhi tadap rahegi dile be karaar me,<br> Hum muntazir rahenge hamesha mazaar me,<br> Dega sadae jabhi hume waqt ka Hussain,<br> Qabron se hum pukarenge ‘Labbayk..(3) Ya Hussain ”</p> 
